      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MEPUNGA SANDY (1) has raced below best last couple, the latest managing only 4th (30.36) last time in a Grade 6 at this track. Has never been out of the money this course and distance including one win. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Has ability and looks hard to stop. WHY MUMMY (2) was game in defeat off the inside draw last start, finishing second and beaten a neck (34.65) behind Tracking You at this track. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Must be included in calculations. SAFFRON MONSOON (5) has mixed form recently, finishing fourth (29.89) in a Mix 6/7 at this track latest but did run well two back when in the frame. Can find the frame this time. DEL AMITRI (8) is a last-start placegetter with solid claims again.",
